- normalize collapses every council config to one 'default' preset (always
  enabled); save replaces presets instead of merging so stale ones can't linger
- desktop: removed preset dropdown, Enabled toggle, Default line — page is now
  just the 4 seats + judge + chairman model pickers
- CLI: 'hermes council list' prints the single roster; configure walks the 4
  fixed seats; delete subcommand removed (nothing to delete)
- tests: 70 python passed, 36 desktop passed, tsc clean
